Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:02.50,Ask,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)}WHAT SHOULD YOU\NBE BORN AS NEXT?\N{\fs40}{\c&H30B8F0&}TELL ME IN THE COMMENTS
